WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.667
TETRIS

00:00:00.834 --> 00:00:01.376
TETRIS

00:00:01.459 --> 00:00:01.960
TETRIS

00:00:02.043 --> 00:00:02.419
TETRIS

00:00:02.669 --> 00:00:03.545
TETRIS

00:00:03.753 --> 00:00:04.921
It's the perfect game.

00:00:07.966 --> 00:00:10.009
It was the most beautiful thing I'd ever seen.

00:00:13.221 --> 00:00:14.931
I played for five minutes,

00:00:15.807 --> 00:00:17.809
I still see falling blocks in my dreams.

00:00:19.060 --> 00:00:20.687
It's poetry. Art and math

00:00:20.687 --> 00:00:22.939
all working in magical synchronicity, it's...

00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:27.610
it's the perfect game.

00:00:27.610 --> 00:00:28.069
TETRIS

00:00:28.361 --> 00:00:28.820
TETRIS

00:00:28.945 --> 00:00:29.362
TETRIS

00:00:29.487 --> 00:00:29.821
TETRIS

00:00:30.238 --> 00:00:31.114
TETRIS,

00:00:32.031 --> 00:00:32.615
I don't get it.

00:00:35.034 --> 00:00:37.829
It's a combination of tetra, Greek for four,

00:00:38.371 --> 00:00:39.122
and tennis.

00:00:39.122 --> 00:00:39.831
Tennis?

00:00:39.831 --> 00:00:41.082
The Russian inventor he likes tennis.

00:00:42.584 --> 00:00:44.919
This game isn't just addictive.

00:00:44.919 --> 00:00:46.546
It stays with you.

00:00:46.546 --> 00:00:49.215
This is a once in a lifetime opportunity.

00:00:50.049 --> 00:00:51.843
Henk, only ten other people in the world have

00:00:51.843 --> 00:00:53.303
seen what you are about to see.

00:00:55.013 --> 00:00:56.556
It's called the Game Boy.

00:00:56.556 --> 00:00:57.891
Package it with TETRIS.

00:00:57.891 --> 00:00:59.058
Can you get us the rights?

00:01:01.811 --> 00:01:03.980
The Soviet Union has worldwide rights.

00:01:03.980 --> 00:01:05.190
Nothing gets out easily.

00:01:05.190 --> 00:01:06.274
I'm gonna go to Moscow.

00:01:06.691 --> 00:01:07.776
You're walking into a country

00:01:07.776 --> 00:01:09.194
that still considers America

00:01:09.194 --> 00:01:10.403
enemy numero uno.

00:01:11.154 --> 00:01:11.821
Okie Dokie.

00:01:12.489 --> 00:01:13.656
You sure you don't have to talk to your

00:01:13.656 --> 00:01:14.616
wife about this first?

00:01:14.616 --> 00:01:15.617
Pioneers

00:01:16.743 --> 00:01:17.911
have to bet the house to win.

00:01:17.911 --> 00:01:19.287
But not literally.

00:01:19.287 --> 00:01:20.079
Listen,

00:01:21.539 --> 00:01:25.543
have you ever heard our apartment this quiet before?

00:01:28.171 --> 00:01:30.215
This is the inventor of TETRIS.

00:01:30.215 --> 00:01:31.633
Your game is brilliant.

00:01:31.633 --> 00:01:33.051
I'm gonna make you a millionaire.

00:01:33.051 --> 00:01:33.593
Mr. Rogers,

00:01:33.593 --> 00:01:35.345
have you ever negotiated with the Soviets?

00:01:36.304 --> 00:01:37.430
We're here for TETRIS.

00:01:39.933 --> 00:01:41.559
What did he say? I don't speak Russian.

00:01:44.521 --> 00:01:46.606
The most powerful men in Communist Party

00:01:46.606 --> 00:01:48.274
is watching you and your family.

00:01:48.775 --> 00:01:50.235
Do you know where your husband is?

00:01:50.235 --> 00:01:51.194
What the hell is going on?

00:01:51.778 --> 00:01:53.071
The world is changing

00:01:53.071 --> 00:01:56.074
and Soviet Union will not be left behind.

00:01:56.074 --> 00:01:57.951
You want to play with the big boys?

00:01:57.951 --> 00:02:00.078
This is how the world works.

00:02:00.078 --> 00:02:00.954
Where is my money?

00:02:00.954 --> 00:02:02.497
This is insane.

00:02:02.497 --> 00:02:03.456
We can't protect you.

00:02:03.456 --> 00:02:05.416
Sometimes you got to forget the rules?

00:02:06.501 --> 00:02:10.713
♪Will things ever be the same again♪

00:02:10.713 --> 00:02:12.173
GO, GO, GO!

00:02:12.173 --> 00:02:13.466
♪It's the final♪

00:02:14.384 --> 00:02:15.468
♪countdown♪

00:02:16.636 --> 00:02:17.470
This is criminal.

00:02:18.596 --> 00:02:19.514
♪countdown♪

00:02:19.973 --> 00:02:21.599
The Soviet Union is about to implode.

00:02:22.725 --> 00:02:23.893
They're lying, everybody's lying.

00:02:23.893 --> 00:02:24.394
Go home!

00:02:24.394 --> 00:02:25.436
The calvary is coming.

00:02:25.436 --> 00:02:26.229
We don't have time.

00:02:26.229 --> 00:02:27.146
I have a plan.

00:02:27.146 --> 00:02:28.690
Alexey Alexey... Woah!

00:02:30.733 --> 00:02:34.112
Oh, come on you guys are the kings of cliffhangers.

00:02:41.035 --> 00:02:41.995
Not too bad.

00:02:41.995 --> 00:02:47.000
♪It's the final countdown♪

